WEBVTT

00:08.551 --> 00:10.000
- ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.034 --> 00:11.793
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:11.827 --> 00:13.517
- I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:13.551 --> 00:15.517
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:15.551 --> 00:18.103
- ♪ OHH...
- ♪ 噢...

00:18.137 --> 00:20.620
♪ WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.655 --> 00:22.655
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:22.689 --> 00:24.689
- ♪ ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:24.724 --> 00:26.379
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:26.413 --> 00:28.689
- ♪ IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
BE SOMETHING YOU WISH ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你所希望的 ♪

00:28.724 --> 00:30.206
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:30.241 --> 00:32.862
- ♪ THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH ♪
- ♪ 然后掉到甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:32.896 --> 00:34.586
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
- READY?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:34.620 --> 00:36.620
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:36.655 --> 00:38.551
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:38.586 --> 00:40.517
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:40.551 --> 00:41.758
- SPONGEBOB
- 海绵宝宝

00:41.793 --> 00:44.068
SQUAREPANTS!
方裤！

00:44.103 --> 00:46.517
[laughing]
[笑]

00:46.551 --> 00:48.827
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

00:48.862 --> 00:50.275
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

01:05.620 --> 01:09.103
radio announcer: GOOD MORNING,
BIKINI BOTTOM!
广播播音员：早上好，
比基尼泳裤！

01:09.137 --> 01:11.137
IT IS A VERY SPECIAL DAY TODAY
今天是非常特别的一天

01:11.172 --> 01:14.000
BECAUSE WE'VE GOT THE NEW
SINGLE FROM BOYS WHO CRY,
因为我们有新的
哭泣的男孩的单曲，

01:14.034 --> 01:16.000
IT'S ALL ABOUT YOU.
一切都与您有关。

01:16.034 --> 01:18.793
- ♪ IT'S ALL ABOUT YOU, GIRL
- ♪ 这都是关于你的，女孩

01:18.827 --> 01:21.275
♪ ON YOUR 16TH BIRTHDAY
♪ 在你 16 岁生日那天

01:21.310 --> 01:23.620
♪ WE'LL PAY ATTENTION TO YOU,
GIRL ♪
♪ 我们会关注您，
女孩♪

01:23.655 --> 01:26.689
♪ EVERYONE HAS TO DO
JUST WHAT YOU SAY ♪
♪ 每个人都必须做
只要你说的 ♪

01:26.724 --> 01:30.517
♪ YOU'LL GET YOUR VERY OWN
SPOTLIGHT TONIGHT ♪
♪ 你会得到你自己的
今晚的焦点♪

01:30.551 --> 01:32.827
♪ 'CAUSE IT'S ALL ABOUT YOU
♪ 因为一切都与你有关

01:32.862 --> 01:35.172
♪ YEAH, IT'S ALL ABOUT PEARL
♪ 是的，一切都与珍珠有关

01:35.206 --> 01:37.241
♪ YOU'RE THE BIRTHDAY GIRL
♪ 你就是生日女孩

01:37.275 --> 01:39.827
- YEAH, IT'S ALL ABOUT ME.
- 是的，都是关于我的。

01:39.862 --> 01:40.827
- ♪ YEAH, PEARL
- ♪ 是的，珍珠

01:40.862 --> 01:44.137
- ON MY 16TH BIRTHDAY.
- 在我 16 岁生日那天。

01:44.172 --> 01:47.344
I WANT MUSIC AND CLOTHES
AND SHINY THINGS.
我想要音乐和衣服
和闪亮的东西。

01:47.379 --> 01:50.275
SO GIVE IT UP RIGHT AWAY.
所以请立即放弃。

01:50.310 --> 01:52.517
EVERYBODY
IN THE WHOLE WIDE WORLD
大家
在整个世界

01:52.551 --> 01:55.172
THEY HAVE TO PAY ATTENTION
TO ME.
他们必须注意
对我来说。

01:55.206 --> 01:57.172
IT'S ALL ABOUT ME, ME...
都是关于我的，我的……

01:57.206 --> 01:58.655
AND GUESS WHO.
猜猜是谁。

01:58.689 --> 01:59.724
ME!
我！

01:59.758 --> 02:02.172
[all gasp]
[全都喘气]

02:02.206 --> 02:03.344
[gasps]
[喘气]

02:03.379 --> 02:04.793
crash!
碰撞！

02:04.827 --> 02:06.586
- NEPTUNE'S TREASURES!
- 海王星的宝藏！

02:06.620 --> 02:08.344
- MORNING, DADDY.
- 早上好，爸爸。

02:08.379 --> 02:10.689
- ARE YOU SURE YOU WOULDN'T
PREFER A ROOM
- 你确定你不会吗
喜欢一个房间

02:10.724 --> 02:11.689
ON THE GROUND FLOOR?
在一楼？

02:11.724 --> 02:13.517
- OH, DADDY.
- 哦，爸爸。

02:13.551 --> 02:16.862
I'M JUST EXCITED BECAUSE
TOMORROW'S A VERY SPECIAL DAY.
我只是很兴奋因为
明天是非常特别的一天。

02:16.896 --> 02:17.862
- [gulps]
- [吞咽]

02:17.896 --> 02:19.172
IT IS?
这是？

02:19.206 --> 02:21.827
OH, I MEAN, IT IS!
哦，我的意思是，确实如此！

02:21.862 --> 02:23.689
VERY SPECIAL!
非常特别！

02:23.724 --> 02:26.517
VERY, VERY SPECIAL INDEED.
确实非常非常特别。

02:26.551 --> 02:29.034
- YOU HAVE NO IDEA WHAT DAY
TOMORROW IS, DO YOU?
- 你不知道哪一天
明天就是，你呢？

02:29.068 --> 02:30.034
- NONE AT ALL.
- 完全没有。

02:30.068 --> 02:33.517
- IT'S MY 16TH BIRTHDAY!
- 今天是我 16 岁生日！

02:33.551 --> 02:34.724
- I KNEW THAT.
- 我知道这一点。

02:34.758 --> 02:37.172
HOW COULD YOU THINK
I WOULDN'T KNOW THAT?
你怎么会这么想
我不知道吗？

02:37.206 --> 02:38.655
WHAT ARE YOU GOING TO BE, 12?
12岁，你想成为什么？

02:38.689 --> 02:40.758
- I'M GOING TO BE 16!
- 我马上就 16 岁了！

02:40.793 --> 02:44.344
IT'S ONLY THE MOST IMPORTANT
BIRTHDAY IN MY ENTIRE LIFE.
这只是最重要的
我一生中的生日。

02:44.379 --> 02:46.862
IF I DON'T HAVE
A COMPLETELY AWESOME PARTY,
如果我没有
一场非常棒的派对，

02:46.896 --> 02:49.689
MY WHOLE HIGH SCHOOL REPUTATION
WILL COLLAPSE.
我整个高中的声誉
将会崩溃。

02:49.724 --> 02:50.862
I'LL HAVE TO DROP OUT.
我必须退学。

02:50.896 --> 02:52.172
I WON'T GO OFF TO COLLEGE.
我不会去上大学。

02:52.206 --> 02:53.620
I'LL NEVER LEAVE HOME.
我永远不会离开家。

02:53.655 --> 02:56.586
YOU'LL HAVE TO SUPPORT ME
FOR THE REST OF MY LIFE.
你必须支持我
在我的余生中。

02:56.620 --> 02:58.068
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

02:58.103 --> 03:00.517
WELL,
WE DON'T WANT THAT TO HAPPEN.
嗯，
我们不希望这种情况发生。

03:00.551 --> 03:03.758
- THEN PROMISE ME YOU'LL GIVE
ME A REAL PARTY THIS YEAR.
- 那么答应我你会给予
今年我是一个真正的派对。

03:03.793 --> 03:05.896
AND DON'T BE CHEAP.
并且不要贪图便宜。

03:05.931 --> 03:07.655
[bell ringing]
[铃声响起]

03:07.689 --> 03:09.172
HI, GIRLS.
嗨，女孩们。

03:09.206 --> 03:10.172
- HI, PEARL.
- 嗨，珍珠。

03:10.206 --> 03:11.448
- ARE YOU GUYS COMING
- 你们来吗

03:11.482 --> 03:13.862
TO MY TOTALLY CORAL
BIRTHDAY PARTY TOMORROW?
致我的珊瑚
明天生日派对？

03:13.896 --> 03:15.275
- I DON'T KNOW, PEARL.
- 我不知道，珀尔。

03:15.310 --> 03:18.517
IS THIS GOING TO BE AS TOTALLY
CORAL AS LAST YEAR
这完全是这样吗？
与去年一样的珊瑚色

03:18.551 --> 03:22.241
WHEN YOUR DAD PASSED OUT
PAPER CLIPS AS PARTY FAVORS?
当你爸爸昏倒时
回形针作为派对礼物？

03:22.275 --> 03:23.655
[girls laugh]
[女孩们笑]

03:23.689 --> 03:26.000
- REMEMBER THE TIME
WE ALL HAD TO SHARE ONE BALLOON?
- 记住时间
我们必须共用一个气球？

03:26.034 --> 03:27.172
PLEASE.
请。

03:27.206 --> 03:29.172
- REMEMBER THE PONY RIDE?
- 还记得骑小马吗？

03:29.206 --> 03:31.827
I CAN'T WAIT TO SEE
HOW HE RUINS THIS YEAR.
我等不及要看
他今年是如何毁掉的。

03:31.862 --> 03:33.827
[laughing]
[笑]

03:33.862 --> 03:37.000
- [sobbing]
- [抽泣]

03:37.034 --> 03:38.103
DADDY!
爸爸！

03:38.137 --> 03:39.103
[rumbling]
- UH-OH.
[隆隆声]
- 呃-哦。

03:39.137 --> 03:41.724
EVERYBODY, BRACE FOR IMPACT!
大家，准备好迎接冲击吧！

03:41.758 --> 03:43.655
[rumbling and sobbing,
customers screaming]
[隆隆声和抽泣声，
顾客尖叫]

03:43.689 --> 03:46.034
TELL ME YOU'VE GOT SOMETHING
TOTALLY CORAL
告诉我你有东西
完全珊瑚色

03:46.068 --> 03:48.206
PLANNED FOR MY
BIRTHDAY PARTY.
为我计划的
生日聚会。

03:48.241 --> 03:50.827
- NOW, NOW,
DON'T SNAP YOUR MIZZENMAST.
- 现在，现在，
不要折断你的后桅。

03:50.862 --> 03:52.517
EVERYTHING IS ALL SET.
一切都已准备就绪。

03:52.551 --> 03:55.034
WHY, I'VE ALREADY
GOT THE PARTY FAVORS:
为什么，我已经
得到了派对的青睐：

03:55.068 --> 03:57.344
BUBBLE WRAP!
气泡膜！

03:57.379 --> 04:00.206
THIS YEAR'S GONNA BE A BLAST.
今年将会是爆炸性的一年。

04:00.241 --> 04:03.413
- DADDY, YOU RUINED
ALL MY BIRTHDAY PARTIES.
- 爸爸，你毁了
我所有的生日派对。

04:03.448 --> 04:05.241
BUT YOU BETTER NOT
RUIN THIS ONE.
但你最好不要
毁掉这个。

04:05.275 --> 04:07.413
NOW, PROMISE ME
YOU WON'T BE CHEAP.
现在，答应我
你不会便宜的。

04:07.448 --> 04:08.827
- [gulps]
I PROMISE.
- [吞咽]
我保证。

04:08.862 --> 04:09.827
- GOOD.
- 好的。

04:09.862 --> 04:12.586
BECAUSE I MADE A LIST.
因为我列了一个清单。

04:14.862 --> 04:20.000
NOW, I WANT EVERYTHING
ON THIS LIST AT MY PARTY.
现在，我想要一切
在我的聚会上的这份名单上。

04:20.034 --> 04:21.689
BYE.
再见。

04:21.724 --> 04:24.689
I'LL BE AT THE MALL
WITH MY FRIENDS.
我会去商场
和我的朋友们。

04:24.724 --> 04:25.827
- SPONGEBOB!
- 海绵宝宝！

04:25.862 --> 04:27.000
- YES, MR. KRABS?
- 是的，先生。螃蟹？

04:27.034 --> 04:28.344
- WHILE I PLAN THE PARTY,
- 当我计划聚会时，

04:28.379 --> 04:30.000
I WANT YOU
TO BUY PEARL'S PRESENT.
我想要你
购买珍珠的礼物。

04:30.034 --> 04:31.172
HERE YOU GO, BOY.
给你，男孩。

04:31.206 --> 04:32.827
- WHAT'S THIS, MR. KRABS?
- 这是什么，先生。螃蟹？

04:32.862 --> 04:33.620
- IT'S ME CREDIT CARD.
- 这是我的信用卡。

04:33.655 --> 04:35.413
YOU USE IT INSTEAD OF MONEY.
您用它代替金钱。

04:35.448 --> 04:38.344
- I CAN BUY STUFF
WITH JUST THIS PIECE OF PLASTIC?
- 我可以买东西
就用这块塑料？

04:38.379 --> 04:39.793
I DON'T NEED MONEY?
我不需要钱？

04:39.827 --> 04:41.689
- EXACTLY.
- WHOA.
- 确切地。
- 哇哦。

04:41.724 --> 04:44.344
- NOW REMEMBER, NOTHING'S TOO
GOOD FOR ME LITTLE PEARL.
- 现在记住，没有什么是太
对我有好处，小珍珠。

04:44.379 --> 04:46.379
I WANTED TO GIVE HER NOTHING,
我什么都不想给她，

04:46.413 --> 04:48.344
[mocking tone]
BUT SHE'S TOO GOOD FOR THAT.
[嘲讽语气]
但她太优秀了。

04:48.379 --> 04:50.689
NOW FOLLOW HER AROUND
AND SEE WHAT SHE LIKES.
现在跟随她
看看她喜欢什么。

04:50.724 --> 04:52.827
YOU KNOW,
DO SOME DETECTIVE WORK.
你知道，
做一些侦探工作。

04:52.862 --> 04:54.172
- DETECTIVE WORK.
- 侦探工作。

04:54.206 --> 04:55.896
I'M GOING UNDERCOVER.
我要去卧底。

04:58.724 --> 05:00.655
- SO THAT'S WHEN MARCIE
TOLD ME
- 这就是玛西的时候
告诉我

05:00.689 --> 05:03.551
THAT JULIE SAID
THAT ANGELA DID LIKE BRAD.
朱莉说的
安吉拉确实喜欢布拉德。

05:03.586 --> 05:05.413
- OH.
- 哦。

05:05.448 --> 05:07.241
- ANGELA LIKES BRAD.
- 安吉拉喜欢布拉德。

05:07.275 --> 05:08.482
- OH, MY GOSH!
- 哦，天哪！

05:08.517 --> 05:10.344
THIS IS THE GREATEST THING
I HAVE SEEN
这是最伟大的事情
我见过

05:10.379 --> 05:12.482
IN THE WHOLE WORLD.
在全世界。

05:15.413 --> 05:16.620
- I'D LIKE TO BUY
THAT PIECE OF PLASTIC
- 我想买
那块塑料

05:16.655 --> 05:18.482
WITH THIS PIECE OF PLASTIC.
用这块塑料。

05:18.517 --> 05:21.241
- MR. KRABS, HUH?
- 先生。螃蟹，嗯？

05:21.275 --> 05:22.655
QUICK.
HOW DO YOU SPELL "KRABS"?
快的。
“蟹”怎么拼写？

05:22.689 --> 05:23.862
- UM...
- 嗯...

05:23.896 --> 05:25.448
I'M PRETTY SURE
IT HAS A "B" IN IT.
我很确定
它有一个“B”。

05:25.482 --> 05:28.241
- CLOSE ENOUGH.
- 足够接近。

05:28.275 --> 05:29.241
HERE YOU GO, KID.
给你，孩子。

05:29.275 --> 05:30.793
- THAT'S IT?
HUH.
- 就是这样？
呵呵。

05:30.827 --> 05:33.586
I'LL NEVER UNDERSTAND
THE WORKINGS OF HIGH FINANCE.
我永远不会明白
高金融的运作。

05:33.620 --> 05:34.758
- WOW.
- 哇。

05:34.793 --> 05:37.000
THIS IS THE GREATEST THING
I'VE EVER SEEN
这是最伟大的事情
我见过

05:37.034 --> 05:38.724
IN THE WHOLE WORLD.
在全世界。

05:38.758 --> 05:40.724
GLITTER GLOSS.
闪光光泽。

05:40.758 --> 05:41.551
- OH, NO.
- 哦，不。

05:41.586 --> 05:43.068
I BOUGHT THE WRONG PRESENT.
我买错了礼物。

05:43.103 --> 05:45.000
- PEARL,
YOU HAVE GOT TO SEE THIS.
- 珍珠，
你一定要看看这个。

05:45.034 --> 05:46.586
- COMING, JUDY.
- 来了，朱迪。

05:46.620 --> 05:47.655
- OH...
- 哦...

05:47.689 --> 05:49.517
HMM...
唔...

05:49.551 --> 05:51.758
HUH?
嗯？

05:51.793 --> 05:55.241
- NOW, THIS IS OBVIOUSLY
THE GREATEST PRESENT EVER.
- 现在，这很明显
有史以来最伟大的礼物。

05:55.275 --> 05:56.620
[Pearl squealing]
[珍珠尖叫声]

05:56.655 --> 06:00.172
THIS IS THE GREATEST THING
IN THE WHOLE WORLD!
这是最伟大的事情
在全世界！

06:00.206 --> 06:02.413
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

06:02.448 --> 06:04.413
- THE BANNER'S UP, MR. KRABS.
- 横幅竖起来了，先生。螃蟹。

06:04.448 --> 06:06.586
- I'VE HAD THAT
SINCE THE DAY SHE WAS BORN.
- 我已经这样了
从她出生那天起。

06:06.620 --> 06:08.827
[sniffles]
I GOT IT ON SALE.
[抽鼻子]
我特价了。

06:08.862 --> 06:11.482
- I'M SURE SHE'LL LOVE IT,
MR. KRABS.
- 我相信她会喜欢它，
先生。螃蟹。

06:11.517 --> 06:13.620
- [blows nose]
- [擤鼻子]

06:14.896 --> 06:17.827
- THIS SEA PONY
IS THE CUTEST THING EVER.
- 这头海马
是有史以来最可爱的东西。

06:17.862 --> 06:21.344
DO YOU WANT TO COME HOME
AND BE MY PONY?
你想回家吗
成为我的小马吗？

06:21.379 --> 06:23.448
- [panting]
- WEE!
- [气喘吁吁]
- 哇！

06:23.482 --> 06:25.068
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

06:27.206 --> 06:28.379
- PEARL, COME HERE.
- 珀尔，过来。

06:28.413 --> 06:30.172
THIS IS SO CORAL.
这太珊瑚了。

06:30.206 --> 06:31.793
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

06:34.965 --> 06:38.482
- OH, MY GOSH.
IT'S BILLY FISHKIN.
- 哦，天哪。
这是比利·菲什金。

06:38.517 --> 06:40.172
all: HI, BILLY.
所有人：嗨，比利。

06:40.206 --> 06:41.172
- MEEP.
- 米普。

06:41.206 --> 06:43.034
[all sighing]
[大家叹气]

06:43.068 --> 06:45.000
- OH, ISN'T HE DREAMY?
- 哦，他不是很梦幻吗？

06:47.896 --> 06:49.172
[scanner beeps]
[扫描仪发出蜂鸣声]

06:49.206 --> 06:51.172
- PRICE CHECK ON FOUR.
- 四点价格检查。

06:51.206 --> 06:52.551
- MEEP.
- 米普。

06:52.586 --> 06:55.034
- I FINISHED PEARL'S PORTRAIT,
MR. KRABS.
- 我完成了《珍珠的肖像》，
先生。螃蟹。

06:55.068 --> 06:58.379
IT'S A TRUE MASTERPIECE.
这是真正的杰作。

06:58.413 --> 06:59.758
- HEY...
- 嘿...

06:59.793 --> 07:01.931
MAYBE I SHOULD HAVE HIRED
THAT ICE SCULPTOR.
也许我应该雇用
那个冰雕师。

07:01.965 --> 07:03.103
- ICE SCULPTOR?
- 冰雕师？

07:03.137 --> 07:05.241
ANY FOOL CAN SCULPT IN ICE.
任何傻瓜都可以在冰上雕刻。

07:05.275 --> 07:06.931
IT TAKES TRUE GENIUS
这需要真正的天才

07:06.965 --> 07:10.172
TO TRANSFORM 400 POUNDS
OF RAW KRABBY PATTIES
变形 400 磅
生蟹肉饼

07:10.206 --> 07:13.413
INTO A WORK OF SUCH MAJESTY.
成为如此宏伟的作品。

07:13.448 --> 07:15.000
- YEAH.
- 是的。

07:15.034 --> 07:16.689
WELL,
WE'VE GOT THE DECOR COVERED.
嗯，
我们已经做好了装饰。

07:16.724 --> 07:19.413
NOW, HOW ABOUT ENTERTAINMENT?
LET ME SEE HERE.
现在，娱乐怎么样？
让我看看这里。

07:19.448 --> 07:22.896
PEARL WANTS SOME BOY BAND
CALLED BOYS WHO CRY.
珀尔想要一些男孩乐队
被称为哭泣的男孩。

07:22.931 --> 07:24.172
- BOYS WHO CRY?
- 哭泣的男孩？

07:24.206 --> 07:25.620
THEY'RE MY FAVORITE BAND.
他们是我最喜欢的乐队。

07:25.655 --> 07:28.896
THEY CHARGE A MILLION DOLLARS
JUST TO SHOW UP.
他们要价一百万美元
只是为了出现。

07:28.931 --> 07:31.103
IF YOU WANT THEM TO LIP-SYNC,
IT'LL RUN INTO REAL MONEY.
如果你想让他们对口型，
它会投入真金白银。

07:31.137 --> 07:32.310
- YOU'RE A REAL FAN, HUH?
- 你是一个真正的粉丝，是吗？

07:32.344 --> 07:33.344
- OH, YEAH.
- 哦，是的。

07:33.379 --> 07:35.310
I KNOW ALL THEIR SONGS.
我知道他们所有的歌曲。

07:35.344 --> 07:36.344
- HMM.
- 唔。

07:36.379 --> 07:38.068
ALL THEIR SONGS?
他们所有的歌曲？

07:46.000 --> 07:48.068
beep!
cha-ching!
嘟！
查清！

07:54.655 --> 07:56.482
beep!
cha-ching!
嘟！
查清！

08:03.655 --> 08:06.793
[beeping and cash register
dinging repeatedly]
[蜂鸣声和收银机
叮叮当当]

08:06.827 --> 08:10.413
- WOULDN'T IT BE COOL IF MY DAD
GOT ME THIS FOR MY BIRTHDAY?
- 如果我爸爸是的话，那不是很酷吗
给我买了这个作为我的生日礼物吗？

08:10.448 --> 08:12.517
- IT SURE WOULD BE,
IF HE WAS COOL...
- 肯定会是，
如果他很酷的话...

08:12.551 --> 08:14.724
WHICH HE'S NOT.
[girls laughing]
但他不是。
[女孩们笑]

08:14.758 --> 08:18.620
- YEAH, HE PROBABLY GOT ME
ANOTHER BOX OF STAPLES.
- 是的，他可能抓住了我
另一盒订书钉。

08:20.206 --> 08:22.586
- IT'S ALMOST TIME
FOR THE PARTY TO START.
- 时间快到了
派对开始。

08:22.620 --> 08:24.482
- I'M BACK, MR. KRABS.
- 我回来了，先生。螃蟹。

08:24.517 --> 08:25.827
- SPONGEBOB,
WHAT TOOK YOU SO LONG?
- 海绵宝宝，
你怎么花了这么长时间？

08:25.862 --> 08:27.551
AND WHERE'S PEARL'S PRESENT?
珀尔现在在哪里？

08:27.586 --> 08:30.517
- THE DELIVERY TRUCK
WILL BE HERE MOMENTARILY.
- 送货卡车
WILL BE HERE MOMENTARILY.

08:30.551 --> 08:32.310
- HERE SHE COMES, MR. KRABS.
- 她来了，先生。螃蟹。

08:32.344 --> 08:35.758
- EVERYBODY GET IN POSITION.
- 每个人都就位。

08:35.793 --> 08:39.000
all: HAPPY BIRTHDAY!
全体：生日快乐！

08:39.034 --> 08:40.931
- "IT'S A BOY"?
- “这是一个男孩”？

08:40.965 --> 08:42.310
[laughing]
[笑]

08:42.344 --> 08:44.172
- DADDY!
- 爸爸！

08:45.620 --> 08:46.655
[all crunching]
[一切都在嘎吱嘎吱]

08:46.689 --> 08:49.172
[all gagging and coughing]
[全都作呕和咳嗽]

08:49.206 --> 08:51.620
- STALE POPCORN.
- 不新鲜的爆米花。

08:54.586 --> 08:56.655
IT TASTES LIKE DISHWATER.
尝起来像洗碗水。

08:56.689 --> 08:58.482
- IT IS DISHWATER.
- 这是洗碗水。

08:58.517 --> 09:01.310
[all gagging and coughing]
[全都作呕和咳嗽]

09:01.344 --> 09:04.586
- IS THAT SUPPOSED TO BE ME?
- 那应该是我吗？

09:04.620 --> 09:06.931
IT'S MADE OUT OF KRABBY
PATTIES.
它是由 KRABBY 制成的
肉饼。

09:06.965 --> 09:08.724
GROSS!
总的！

09:08.758 --> 09:11.000
- WHO WANTS CAKE?
- 谁想要蛋糕？

09:11.034 --> 09:13.379
- WELL, THE CAKE DOES LOOK GOOD.
- 嗯，蛋糕看起来不错。

09:13.413 --> 09:14.379
chomp!
咀嚼！

09:14.413 --> 09:15.517
[gags]
[笑点]

09:15.551 --> 09:18.034
IT'S MADE OUT OF CARDBOARD.
它是用纸板制成的。

09:18.068 --> 09:19.482
- AND FROSTING.
- 和糖霜。

09:19.517 --> 09:20.517
- WOW, PEARL.
- 哇，珍珠。

09:20.551 --> 09:23.344
16 LAME PARTIES IN A ROW.
连续 16 个蹩脚的派对。

09:23.379 --> 09:25.172
MUST BE A NEW RECORD.
一定是一个新记录。

09:25.206 --> 09:26.482
LET'S GET OUT OF HERE.
我们离开这里吧。

09:26.517 --> 09:27.482
- WAIT.
- 等待。

09:27.517 --> 09:28.517
DON'T LEAVE.
不要离开。

09:28.551 --> 09:31.000
MY DAD GOT BOYS WHO CRY TO PLAY.
我爸爸有一些哭着玩耍的男孩。

09:31.034 --> 09:33.206
YOU DID GET BOYS WHO CRY, RIGHT?
你确实让男孩哭过，对吧？

09:33.241 --> 09:35.482
- OOH, EVEN BETTER, SWEETIE.
- 哦，更好了，亲爱的。

09:35.517 --> 09:36.482
HIT IT.
击中它。

09:36.517 --> 09:38.034
[R&B music begins]
[R&B音乐开始]

09:38.068 --> 09:40.827
- HELLO, LADIES.
- 你好，女士们。

09:40.862 --> 09:43.689
♪ WHEN MY TEAR DUCTS
GIVE ISSUE ♪
♪ 当我的泪管出现时
提出问题♪

09:43.724 --> 09:46.827
♪ I CAN'T USE JUST ANY TISSUE
♪ 我不能只使用纸巾

09:46.862 --> 09:48.482
♪ I NEED FOUR-PLY
♪ 我需要四层

09:48.517 --> 09:49.551
♪ FOUR-PLY
♪ 四层

09:49.586 --> 09:50.551
♪ FOUR-PLY
♪ 四层

09:50.586 --> 09:52.000
♪ WHEN I CRY
♪ 当我哭泣时

09:52.034 --> 09:54.000
♪ HUH!
♪ 哈！

09:54.034 --> 09:56.482
- HEY, THAT IS NOT BOYS WHO CRY.
- 嘿，那不是哭泣的男孩。

09:56.517 --> 09:57.827
- YEAH.
- 是的。

09:57.862 --> 09:59.034
- BOO!
- 嘘！

09:59.068 --> 10:00.034
- WHAT A RIP-OFF.
- 真是骗人的。

10:00.068 --> 10:01.172
- THIS STINKS!
- 这太臭了！

10:01.206 --> 10:03.655
- DADDY, HOW COULD YOU?
- 爸爸，你怎么能这样？

10:03.689 --> 10:08.482
I GAVE YOU A LIST.
我给了你一个清单。

10:08.517 --> 10:11.206
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

10:11.241 --> 10:13.344
- PEARL, COME BACK.
- 珀尔，回来吧。

10:15.344 --> 10:16.689
smack!
咂！

10:18.137 --> 10:19.862
- YOU RUINED EVERYTHING.
- 你毁了一切。

10:19.896 --> 10:23.310
YOU COULDN'T STOP BEING CHEAP,
EVEN FOR ME.
你无法停止贪图便宜，
即使对我来说也是如此。

10:23.344 --> 10:26.172
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

10:26.206 --> 10:28.482
- I'LL MAKE IT UP TO YOU
SOMEHOW, PEARL.
- 我会补偿你的
不知何故，珍珠。

10:28.517 --> 10:30.034
- THAT'S IT!
- 就是这样！

10:30.068 --> 10:31.137
BACK IT UP.
备份。

10:31.172 --> 10:33.000
RIGHT THERE.
就在那里。

10:33.034 --> 10:34.310
LET 'ER GO.
让他走吧。

10:34.344 --> 10:35.965
crash!
碰撞！

10:41.379 --> 10:43.206
- YOU BOUGHT ME A BOAT?
- 你给我买了一条船？

10:43.241 --> 10:44.482
- I DID?
- 我做到了？

10:44.517 --> 10:45.517
I MEAN...
我是说...

10:45.551 --> 10:46.517
I DID?
我做到了？

10:46.551 --> 10:48.206
all: WOW.
所有人：哇。

10:48.241 --> 10:54.034
- OH, DADDY, I DON'T KNOW HOW
IT COULD GET BETTER THAN THIS.
- 哦，爸爸，我不知道怎么办
它可以变得比这更好。

10:54.068 --> 10:55.482
- JUST WATCH.
- 只要看。

10:55.517 --> 10:57.137
HIT IT, BOYS.
打吧，孩子们。

10:57.172 --> 11:00.000
[smooth R&B music begins]
【流畅的R&B音乐开始】

11:00.034 --> 11:02.551
- ♪ IT'S ALL ABOUT YOU, GIRL
- ♪ 这都是关于你的，女孩

11:02.586 --> 11:05.689
♪ ON YOUR 16TH BIRTHDAY
♪ 在你 16 岁生日那天

11:05.724 --> 11:07.758
♪ WE'LL PAY ATTENTION TO YOU,
GIRL ♪
♪ 我们会关注您，
女孩♪

11:07.793 --> 11:11.034
♪ EVERYONE HAS TO DO
JUST WHAT YOU SAY ♪
♪ 每个人都必须做
只要你说的 ♪

11:11.068 --> 11:14.655
♪ YOU'LL GET YOUR VERY OWN
SPOTLIGHT TONIGHT ♪
♪ 你会得到你自己的
今晚的焦点♪

11:14.689 --> 11:16.655
♪ 'CAUSE IT'S ALL ABOUT YOU
♪ 因为一切都与你有关

11:16.689 --> 11:19.068
♪ YEAH, IT'S ALL ABOUT PEARL
♪ 是的，一切都与珍珠有关

11:19.103 --> 11:20.413
♪ YOU'RE THE BIRTHDAY GIRL
- BOY.
♪ 你就是生日女孩
- 男孩。

11:20.448 --> 11:22.379
HOW MUCH IS ALL THIS COSTING ME?
这一切让我付出了多少代价？

11:22.413 --> 11:24.172
- HERE'S THE RECEIPT.
- [gasps]
- 这是收据。
- [喘气]

11:24.206 --> 11:25.172
[alarm bell rings]
[警钟响起]

11:25.206 --> 11:26.172
I OUGHT TO--
我应该——

11:26.206 --> 11:27.448
- OH, DADDY.
- 哦，爸爸。

11:27.482 --> 11:30.482
YOU GOT ME EVERYTHING I WANTED.
你给了我我想要的一切。

11:30.517 --> 11:32.689
smooch!
接吻！

11:32.724 --> 11:36.827
- AH, NOTHING'S TOO GOOD
FOR ME DAUGHTER.
- 啊，没什么太好的
为了我的女儿。

11:36.862 --> 11:39.517
- YOU'RE A GOOD DAD, MR. KRABS.
- 你是个好爸爸，先生。螃蟹。

11:39.551 --> 11:54.137
- DON'T PUSH YOUR LUCK, BOY.
- 别再碰运气了，孩子。

11:54.172 --> 11:55.655
- OKAY, GARY.
- 好吧，加里。

11:55.689 --> 11:57.758
READY FOR
YOUR YEARLY SHELL-WAXING?
准备好
您每年都会进行贝壳打蜡吗？

11:57.793 --> 11:59.000
- [meows]
- [喵]

12:02.241 --> 12:05.965
[whirring]
[呼呼]

12:06.000 --> 12:07.620
JUST LOOK AT THAT SHINE.
看看那光芒。

12:07.655 --> 12:11.137
NOW, LET'S CHECK
UNDER THE HOOD.
现在，让我们检查一下
引擎盖下。

12:11.172 --> 12:13.793
JEEZ, GARY.
THIS PLACE IS A REAL SNAIL-STY.
天啊，加里。
这个地方是真正的蜗牛窝。

12:13.827 --> 12:15.068
- [meows]
- [喵]

12:15.103 --> 12:16.482
- STILL?
FROM NEW YEAR'S EVE?
- 仍然？
从除夕开始？

12:16.517 --> 12:17.758
- [horn blowing]
- [吹喇叭]

12:17.793 --> 12:19.000
- WHAT?
- 什么？

12:19.034 --> 12:21.551
I'VE BEEN LOOKING EVERYWHERE
FOR THIS, GARY!
我一直在到处寻找
为此，加里！

12:21.586 --> 12:24.517
MY FAVORITE NOVELTY T-SHIRT.
[doorbell rings]
我最喜欢的新奇 T 恤。
[门铃响]

12:24.551 --> 12:26.034
OOH!
SOMEONE'S HERE.
哦！
有人在这里。

12:28.931 --> 12:31.517
- SPECIAL DELIVERY
FOR SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS.
- 特别送货
对于海绵宝宝来说。

12:31.551 --> 12:33.034
- SPECIAL DELIVERY?
- 特别送货？

12:33.068 --> 12:34.827
JUST FOR ME?
只为我？

12:34.862 --> 12:36.206
YOU THINK I'M...
你以为我是...

12:36.241 --> 12:37.206
SPECIAL?
特别的？

12:37.241 --> 12:39.379
[wailing]
[哀号]

12:39.413 --> 12:42.068
- ALL RIGHT,
DO WE HAVE TO GO THROUGH THIS
- 好吧，
我们必须经历这个吗

12:42.103 --> 12:44.034
EVERY TIME I GIVE YOU YOUR MAIL?
每次我给你邮件？

12:44.068 --> 12:45.206
SHEESH!
嘘！

12:45.241 --> 12:46.448
- WHAT COULD IT BE TODAY, GARY?
- 今天会是什么，加里？

12:46.482 --> 12:47.448
- [meows]
- [喵]

12:47.482 --> 12:48.517
- A VIDEOTAPE?
- 录像带？

12:48.551 --> 12:50.034
"YOU'RE A WINNER!
“你是赢家！

12:50.068 --> 12:52.482
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS."
海绵宝宝。”

12:52.517 --> 12:55.448
I'M SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
我是海绵宝宝！

12:57.482 --> 12:59.103
TV announcer: KARATE ISLAND!
电视播音员：空手道岛！

12:59.137 --> 13:01.275
A SERENE AND EXOTIC LOCATION
宁静而充满异国情调的地方

13:01.310 --> 13:02.862
WHERE NATURE AND BEAUTY ABOUND
充满自然与美丽的地方

13:02.896 --> 13:05.448
AND HUNDREDS OF FIGHTING STYLES
COLLIDE
以及数百种战斗风格
碰撞

13:05.482 --> 13:07.379
IN A WAVE OF NON-STOP,
PULSATING,
一波又一波不停歇的浪潮中，
脉动，

13:07.413 --> 13:09.551
NO-HOLDS BARRED ACTION!
没有任何限制的行动！

13:09.586 --> 13:12.206
FOR CENTURIES,
THE WORLD'S TOP KARATE ARTISTS
几个世纪以来，
世界顶级空手道艺术家

13:12.241 --> 13:16.379
HAVE JOURNEYED TO THIS LAND
TO BE CROWNED KING OF KARATE.
已经到过这片土地
加冕空手道之王。

13:16.413 --> 13:17.517
- KING...
- 国王...

13:17.551 --> 13:18.689
OF KARATE?
空手道？

13:18.724 --> 13:20.206
announcer: NOW IT'S YOUR
TURN...
播音员：现在是你的了
转...

13:20.241 --> 13:22.034
- SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS.
- 海绵宝宝。

13:22.068 --> 13:24.034
announcer: YOU'VE WON
AN ALL-EXPENSE PAID TRIP
播音员：你赢了
一次全费用付费旅行

13:24.068 --> 13:25.482
TO KARATE ISLAND...
去空手道岛...

13:25.517 --> 13:27.034
HIYAH!
嗨！

13:27.068 --> 13:28.896
WHERE YOU WILL BE CROWNED
THIS YEAR'S
您将在哪里加冕
今年的

13:28.931 --> 13:31.379
KING OF KARATE.
空手道之王。

13:31.413 --> 13:32.655
- OOH...
- 哦...

13:32.689 --> 13:34.206
DID YOU HEAR THAT, GARY?
你听到了吗，加里？

13:34.241 --> 13:36.068
I'M GOING TO CROWNED...
我要加冕...

13:36.103 --> 13:38.896
[shouts indistinctly]
[含糊不清地喊道]

13:38.931 --> 13:40.275
KING OF KARATE!
空手道之王！

13:44.206 --> 13:46.068
WHOO-HOO!
呼呼！

13:46.103 --> 13:49.034
HI...
你好...

13:49.068 --> 13:50.034
YAH!
啊！

13:50.068 --> 13:51.310
- HOWDY, SPONGEBOB.
- 你好，海绵宝宝。

13:51.344 --> 13:52.482
- HELLO, SANDY.
- 你好，桑迪。

13:52.517 --> 13:53.655
HAVE YOU HEARD THE NEWS?
您听到这个消息了吗？

13:53.689 --> 13:55.793
I'VE BEEN INVITED
TO KARATE ISLAND
我已被邀请
前往空手道岛

13:55.827 --> 13:57.551
TO BE CROWNED
THE KING OF KARATE.
加冕
空手道之王。

13:57.586 --> 13:58.724
- KARATE ISLAND?
- 空手道岛？

13:58.758 --> 14:00.000
I'VE NEVER HEARD
OF KARATE ISLAND.
我从来没有听说过
空手道岛。

14:00.034 --> 14:01.482
- OH, SURE, SANDY,
- 哦，当然，桑迪，

14:01.517 --> 14:02.793
ALL THE BIG KARATE EXPERTS
GO THERE.
所有大空手道专家
去那里。

14:02.827 --> 14:04.000
- BUT...
- 但...

14:04.034 --> 14:05.758
MY KARATE IS BETTER THAN YOURS
BY A COUNTRY MILE,
我的空手道比你的好
一英里，

14:05.793 --> 14:07.413
AND I'VE NEVER BEEN INVITED.
而且我从未被邀请过。

14:07.448 --> 14:09.034
- MAYBE YOUR KARATE
WAS THE BEST,
- 也许是你的空手道
是最好的，

14:09.068 --> 14:11.620
BUT NOW THEY'VE RECOGNIZED
A NEW NUMBER ONE.
但现在他们已经认识到
新的第一名。

14:11.655 --> 14:13.551
- THERE'S SOMETHING ROTTEN
IN THE ALAMO.
- 有东西腐烂了
在阿拉莫。

14:13.586 --> 14:14.965
I'D BETTER TAG ALONG WITH YOU
我最好和你一起

14:15.000 --> 14:16.275
AND SEE
IF IT'S ON THE UP-AND-UP.
并查看
如果它是向上的。

14:16.310 --> 14:17.689
- ALL RIGHT, SANDY,
- 好吧，桑迪，

14:17.724 --> 14:19.896
YOU CAN COME WITH ME
TO WITNESS MY "CROWNING" MOMENT.
你可以跟我一起去
见证我的“加冕”时刻。

14:19.931 --> 14:21.000
[laughing]
[笑]

14:24.034 --> 14:25.206
ARE WE THERE YET?
我们到了吗？

14:25.241 --> 14:26.724
- YUP, THAT'S IT OVER THERE.
- 是的，就是那边。

14:26.758 --> 14:28.965
- WHAT MAKES YOU THINK
THAT'S KARATE ISLAND?
- 是什么让你这么想
那是空手道岛？

14:29.000 --> 14:30.206
- I DON'T KNOW.
- 我不知道。

14:30.241 --> 14:31.344
LUCKY GUESS?
你猜幸运吗？

14:43.241 --> 14:46.413
- HELLO, THERE,
THE KING OF KARATE HAS ARRIVED.
- 你好，那里，
空手道之王已经到来。

14:46.448 --> 14:49.689
- WELCOME TO MY ISLAND,
SPONGEBOB-SAN.
- 欢迎来到我的岛屿，
海绵宝宝桑。

14:49.724 --> 14:51.517
- OH, THANK YOU.
-哦，谢谢。

14:51.551 --> 14:52.793
- I AM MASTER UDON.
- 我是乌冬面大师。

14:52.827 --> 14:55.172
- HOWDY, MASTER UDON.
SANDY CHEEKS.
- 你好，乌冬面大师。
沙色的脸颊。

14:55.206 --> 14:57.137
I DO A LITTLE KARATE MYSELF.
我自己也学过一点空手道。

14:57.172 --> 14:58.896
- SANDY, SANDY, SANDY.
- 桑迪，桑迪，桑迪。

14:58.931 --> 15:02.413
MR. UDON ISN'T INTERESTED
IN A KARATE NOVICE LIKE YOU.
先生。乌冬面不感兴趣
像您这样的空手道新手。

15:02.448 --> 15:05.068
HE ONLY HAS TIME FOR ROYALTY.
他只有时间享受王权。

15:05.103 --> 15:06.655
- OH, BROTHER.
- 哦，兄弟。

15:06.689 --> 15:09.206
- PLEASE,
SHOW ME SOME OF YOUR MOVES,
- 请，
给我看看你的一些动作，

15:09.241 --> 15:11.034
MASTER SPONGEBOB.
海绵宝宝大师。

15:11.068 --> 15:14.000
- YOU HEAR THAT, SANDY?
HE CALLED ME "MASTER."
- 你听到了吗，桑迪？
他称我为“大师”。

15:14.034 --> 15:15.793
BRING ON YOUR BEST FIGHTERS!
带上你最好的战士！

15:15.827 --> 15:17.172
I'LL TRY TO GO EASY ON THEM.
我会尽量对他们宽容一些。

15:17.206 --> 15:18.206
- HIYAH!
-嗨！

15:18.241 --> 15:19.827
[thugs growling]
[暴徒咆哮]

15:19.862 --> 15:21.551
- SPONGEBOB,
YOUR KARATE'S NOT GOOD ENOUGH
- 海绵宝宝，
你的空手道还不够好

15:21.586 --> 15:23.034
TO HANDLE THOSE SIDEWINDERS.
对付那些响尾蛇。

15:23.068 --> 15:24.241
- PA-SHAW!
- 帕肖！

15:24.275 --> 15:25.379
WATCH AND LEARN, SISTER.
观看并学习，姐妹。

15:25.413 --> 15:27.517
[shouts indistinctly]
[含糊不清地喊道]

15:27.551 --> 15:31.206
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

15:31.241 --> 15:33.724
[last breath sputters]
[最后一口气]

15:33.758 --> 15:35.448
- YUP, THAT'S HOW
THE KING OF KARATE DOES IT.
- 是的，就是这样
空手道之王做到了。

15:35.482 --> 15:36.896
WHO'S NEXT?
下一个是谁？

15:36.931 --> 15:40.068
- SOMETHING SMELLS
LIKE RANCID RODEO AROUND HERE.
- 有气味
就像这里的腐臭牛仔竞技表演一样。

15:40.103 --> 15:41.517
[thudding]
[重击]

15:41.551 --> 15:43.413
- EXCELLENT.
- 出色的。

15:43.448 --> 15:46.206
TRULY, YOU ARE KING OF KARATE.
确实，您是空手道之王。

15:46.241 --> 15:47.689
- THE ONE AND ONLY.
- 独一无二。

15:47.724 --> 15:50.793
- WE MUST MAKE READY
FOR YOUR CORONATION.
- 我们必须做好准备
为您加冕。

15:50.827 --> 15:53.689
- I'M READY
TO BE KING OF KARATE!
- 我准备好了
成为空手道之王！

15:53.724 --> 15:56.137
[gong crashes]
[锣声响起]

15:56.172 --> 15:57.827
- KING OF KARATE-SAN,
- 空手道之王，

15:57.862 --> 16:01.379
IT IS TIME FOR YOU TO TAKE YOUR
RIGHTFUL PLACE
现在是您采取行动的时候了
正当的地方

16:01.413 --> 16:03.103
ON YOUR THRONE.
在你的宝座上。

16:03.137 --> 16:05.793
- MY THRONE.
- 我的王座。

16:08.586 --> 16:11.206
- ALL RIGHT, UDON,
I'M ONTO YOU.
- 好吧，乌冬面，
我关注你。

16:11.241 --> 16:14.068
THIS PLACE IS AS CROOKED
AS A DIZZY SIDEWINDER.
这个地方很弯曲
作为一个头晕的响尾蛇。

16:14.103 --> 16:15.068
- COME, SANDY,
- 来吧，桑迪，

16:15.103 --> 16:16.551
TAKE YOUR PLACE
NEXT TO THE KING
占据你的位置
国王旁边

16:16.586 --> 16:18.206
AND SHARE
IN MY CROWNING ACHIEVEMENT.
并分享
这是我的最高成就。

16:18.241 --> 16:19.689
clap!
clap!
拍！
拍！

16:19.724 --> 16:22.103
BRING A SEAT
FOR MY AIR-BREATHING FRIEND.
自带座位
为了我呼吸空气的朋友。

16:27.241 --> 16:29.724
- SPONGEBOB,
Y'ALL ARE GETTING A BIT WILY.
- 海绵宝宝，
你们变得有点狡猾了。

16:29.758 --> 16:32.379
- OH, DO I DETECT
A NOTE OF JEALOUSLY, SANDY?
- 哦，我发现了吗
桑迪，嫉妒的意思吗？

16:32.413 --> 16:35.206
- HECK, I COULD KARATE YOU
INTO A COUNTRY FIDDLE
- 哎呀，我可以给你空手道
乡村小提琴

16:35.241 --> 16:37.068
WITH ONE PAW
TIED BEHIND MY BACK.
用一只爪子
绑在我背后。

16:37.103 --> 16:38.103
- [laughing]
- [笑]

16:38.137 --> 16:40.206
BUT WHO'S BEING CROWNED
KING OF KARATE?
但谁会加冕
空手道之王？

16:40.241 --> 16:41.689
NOT YOU.
不是你。

16:41.724 --> 16:43.206
- I'M GETTING OFF
THIS CRAZY TRAIN!
- 我要下车了
这列疯狂的火车！

16:43.241 --> 16:44.724
[mumbling]
[咕哝]

16:44.758 --> 16:47.379
- MASTER, DON'T WORRY
ABOUT HER.
- 主人，别担心
关于她。

16:47.413 --> 16:51.137
SHE IS MISSING OUT ON THE
OPPORTUNITY OF A LIFETIME.
她错过了
一生难得的机会。

16:51.172 --> 16:52.344
[laughs]
[笑]

16:52.379 --> 16:54.793
LET THE CORONATION BEGIN!
让加冕开始吧！

16:54.827 --> 16:57.965
- SANDY'S GONNA MISS OUT
BIG-TIME.
- 桑迪会错过的
伟大的。

17:02.620 --> 17:03.862
[gasps]
[喘气]

17:07.241 --> 17:09.379
click!
点击！

17:09.413 --> 17:10.689
- THAT DANG SPONGEBOB.
- 那该死的海绵宝宝。

17:10.724 --> 17:12.068
WHO DOES HE THINK HE IS?
他以为自己是谁？

17:12.103 --> 17:13.724
I TAUGHT THAT YELLOW EGOMANIAC
我教那个黄色自大狂

17:13.758 --> 17:15.310
EVERYTHING HE KNOWS
ABOUT FIGHTING,
他知道的一切
关于格斗，

17:15.344 --> 17:16.344
AND THAT AIN'T MUCH.
这还不算什么。

17:16.379 --> 17:18.931
- NO!
- 不！

17:18.965 --> 17:20.137
- SPONGEBOB'S IN TROUBLE!
- 海绵宝宝有麻烦了！

17:20.172 --> 17:21.758
[SpongeBob continues screaming]
[海绵宝宝继续尖叫]

17:21.793 --> 17:23.689
SPONGEBOB IS
THE "KING OF KARATE."
海绵宝宝是
“空手道之王”。

17:23.724 --> 17:25.034
HE DOESN'T NEED ME.
他不需要我。

17:25.068 --> 17:26.862
EH, HE CAN HANDLE THIS HIMSELF.
呃，他自己可以解决这个问题。

17:26.896 --> 17:28.586
- SANDY, I NEED YOU!
- 桑迪，我需要你！

17:28.620 --> 17:30.241
I CAN'T HANDLE THIS MYSELF!
我自己处理不了这个事情！

17:30.275 --> 17:31.689
- HOLD ON, BUDDY!
- 坚持住，伙计！

17:31.724 --> 17:34.655
- NO!
- 不！

17:34.689 --> 17:35.655
SANDY!
沙！

17:35.689 --> 17:36.896
- SHE WILL NEVER REACH YOU.
- 她永远不会联系到你。

17:36.931 --> 17:38.344
SHE MUST FIRST PASS THROUGH...
她必须首先通过……

17:38.379 --> 17:39.379
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

17:39.413 --> 17:42.344
- THE FOUR FLOORS OF FEAR.
- 四层恐惧。

17:42.379 --> 17:44.034
- SPONGEBOB?
- 海绵宝宝？

17:44.068 --> 17:45.034
- HA.
- 哈。

17:45.068 --> 17:46.206
HA-HA-HA.
哈哈哈。

17:46.241 --> 17:47.586
YOU CANNOT PASS
你无法通过

17:47.620 --> 17:49.482
UNLESS YOU DEFEAT ME,
THE TICKLER,
除非你打败我
烦人的事，

17:49.517 --> 17:50.758
AND MY IRON-FINGER STYLE.
还有我的铁手指风格。

17:50.793 --> 17:52.379
HA-HA!
哈哈！

17:55.310 --> 17:56.344
HA-HA.
哈哈。

17:56.379 --> 17:57.310
LOOK!
- HUH?
看！
- 嗯？

17:57.344 --> 18:00.137
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

18:00.172 --> 18:02.689
- PREPARE FOR
THE TICKLING OF YOUR LIFE!
- 准备
您生命中的痒痒！

18:02.724 --> 18:04.241
TASTE THESE!
尝尝这些！

18:04.275 --> 18:06.034
OH, NO!
哦，不！

18:06.068 --> 18:07.758
JELLY-FILLED DOUGHNUTS!
果冻甜甜圈！

18:07.793 --> 18:09.551
HOW DID YOU KNOW
THEY WERE MY WEAKNESS?
你怎么知道的
它们是我的弱点吗？

18:09.586 --> 18:11.793
NO ONE CAN RESIST JELLY-FILLED.
没有人能抗拒果冻填充物。

18:11.827 --> 18:12.793
HIYAH!
嗨！

18:12.827 --> 18:15.344
HIYAH!
嗨！

18:15.379 --> 18:17.137
HIYAH!
HIYAH!
嗨！
嗨！

18:17.172 --> 18:18.275
HIYAH!
嗨！

18:18.310 --> 18:19.103
STICKY AROUND.
粘在周围。

18:19.137 --> 18:20.896
I'LL BE BACK WITH THE GLAZED.
我会带着玻璃回来的。

18:20.931 --> 18:23.034
- I COULD USE A WET-NAP.
- 我可以小睡一下。

18:23.068 --> 18:25.310
- ALL RIGHT, WHO'S NEXT?
- 好吧，下一个是谁？

18:25.344 --> 18:26.689
- HALT.
- 停止。

18:26.724 --> 18:31.034
NO ONE ADVANCES PAST ME,
LIP SERVICE,
没有人能超越我，
口头服务，

18:31.068 --> 18:36.068
AND MY POWER-FLEXY
DYNAMO-LIP THRUSTER STYLE.
还有我的 Power-Flexy
发电机唇式推进器风格。

18:36.103 --> 18:37.758
- HIYAH!
-嗨！

18:37.793 --> 18:40.620
- DANCE, SQUIRREL!
DANCE!
- 跳舞吧，松鼠！
舞蹈！

18:42.724 --> 18:44.034
[laughing]
[笑]

18:44.068 --> 18:46.379
- ADVANCED HAIR-DRYER STYLE.
- 先进的吹风机风格。

18:46.413 --> 18:47.724
- [laughing]
- [笑]

18:47.758 --> 18:50.206
WHAT DO YOU EXPECT TO DO
WITH THAT?
你希望做什么
有了那个？

18:50.241 --> 18:53.275
[whirring]
[呼呼]

18:53.310 --> 18:54.448
OH, NO!
哦，不！

18:54.482 --> 18:56.793
NOT CHAPPED LIPS!
嘴唇没有干裂！

18:56.827 --> 18:58.517
OH!
哦！

18:59.793 --> 19:00.827
[grinding]
[研磨]

19:00.862 --> 19:01.862
crunch!
紧缩！

19:01.896 --> 19:04.310
- THAT'S ENOUGH LIP OUT OF YOU.
- 你已经说得够多了。

19:04.344 --> 19:06.344
[crunching]
[嘎吱嘎吱]

19:06.379 --> 19:07.448
[shatters]
[破碎]

19:07.482 --> 19:09.551
WHAA!
哇啊！

19:11.172 --> 19:16.344
- NO ONE HAS EVER MADE IT
TO THE LAIR OF FILTHY PHIL.
- 从来没有人成功过
到肮脏的菲尔的巢穴。

19:17.586 --> 19:20.551
NO ONE PASSES EXCEPT ME.
除了我之外没有人通过。

19:20.586 --> 19:26.310
NOW, FEEL THE STING
OF MY HORRIBLE BODY ODOR!
现在，感受刺痛
我可怕的体臭！

19:26.344 --> 19:30.689
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

19:30.724 --> 19:32.379
[pinging]
[ping]
[ping]
[平]

19:32.413 --> 19:33.655
- HA-HA, PHIL!
- 哈哈，菲尔！

19:33.689 --> 19:36.551
YOUR FOUL STENCH CAN'T PERMEATE
MY FRESH-AIR DOME.
你的恶臭无法渗透
我的新鲜空气穹顶。

19:36.586 --> 19:38.206
- FRESH-AIR DOME?
- 新鲜空气圆顶？

19:38.241 --> 19:40.517
[inhaling]
[吸气]

19:40.551 --> 19:41.689
MAN.
男人。

19:41.724 --> 19:43.517
I REALLY DO STINK.
我真的很臭。

19:47.206 --> 19:49.275
- HIYAH!
-嗨！

19:49.310 --> 19:52.034
- YOU ARE
ONE IMPRESSIVE SQUIRREL.
- 你是
一只令人印象深刻的松鼠。

19:52.068 --> 19:53.965
YOU EVEN MADE A COSTUME CHANGE.
您甚至还改变了服装。

19:54.000 --> 19:55.448
- RELEASE SPONGEBOB!
- 释放海绵宝宝！

19:55.482 --> 19:57.517
- NEVER.
- 绝不。

19:57.551 --> 19:58.862
thud!
砰！

19:58.896 --> 20:01.275
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

20:01.310 --> 20:04.172
- HE IS FORBIDDEN TO LEAVE
UNTIL...
- 他被禁止离开
直到...

20:04.206 --> 20:06.413
HE SIGNS THIS CONTRACT.
他签署了这份合同。

20:06.448 --> 20:08.931
- WHAT ARE YOU TALKING ABOUT?
- REAL ESTATE.
- 你在说什么？
- 房地产。

20:08.965 --> 20:10.206
- YOU MEAN THIS WHOLE THING
WAS A SCAM
- 你的意思是整件事
是一个骗局

20:10.241 --> 20:11.724
TO GET US TO BUY REAL ESTATE?
让我们购买房地产？

20:11.758 --> 20:12.896
- YES.
- 是的。

20:12.931 --> 20:14.862
IF THERE WAS
A REAL KARATE ISLAND,
如果有的话
真正的空手道岛，

20:14.896 --> 20:16.310
I'D BE A MILLIONAIRE.
我会成为百万富翁。

20:16.344 --> 20:18.586
- YOU MEAN
I'M NOT KING OF KARATE?
- 你的意思是
我不是空手道之王？

20:18.620 --> 20:19.620
- NO.
- 不。

20:19.655 --> 20:22.172
BUT YOU COULD BE KING OF CONDOS.
但您可以成为公寓之王。

20:22.206 --> 20:23.689
HERE, LET ME EXPLAIN.
在这里，让我解释一下。

20:23.724 --> 20:25.206
IT'S REALLY QUITE SIMPLE.
这真的很简单。

20:25.241 --> 20:26.482
YOU SEE,
你看，

20:26.517 --> 20:29.862
IF YOU INVEST IN A TIMESHARE
HERE ON CONDO ISLAND,
如果您投资分时度假
在康多岛上，

20:29.896 --> 20:34.241
YOU CAN SEE YOUR EQUITY INCREASE
TENFOLD.
您可以看到您的权益增加
十倍。

20:35.206 --> 20:37.034
PERHAPS YOU
AND YOUR YELLOW FRIEND
也许是你
还有你的黄色朋友

20:37.068 --> 20:39.827
WOULD LIKE TO SET UP
A TIMESHARE PLAN?
想要设置
分时度假计划？

20:39.862 --> 20:41.517
- DON'T DO IT, SANDY!
- 别这么做，桑迪！

20:41.551 --> 20:44.275
- [chanting indistinctly]
- [含糊不清地吟诵]

20:51.206 --> 20:52.620
HIYAH!
嗨！

20:52.655 --> 20:55.896
I WON'T GIVE IN TO YOUR
TIMESHARE VACATION SCAM!
我不会屈服于你的
分时度假骗局！

20:55.931 --> 20:58.620
- THEN GIVE IN TO MY FISTS.
- 那么就屈服于我的拳头吧。

20:58.655 --> 21:01.310
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

21:02.551 --> 21:05.482
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

21:12.241 --> 21:13.379
HIYAH!
嗨！

21:13.413 --> 21:14.586
- [roars]
- [咆哮]

21:22.551 --> 21:25.241
[smacking and groaning]
[咂嘴和呻吟]

21:30.275 --> 21:32.310
[screams]
[尖叫声]

21:41.827 --> 21:43.379
[screams]
[尖叫声]

21:44.896 --> 21:46.827
[screams]
[尖叫声]

21:46.862 --> 21:50.793
[screaming]
[尖叫]

21:50.827 --> 21:53.137
splash!
溅！

21:53.172 --> 21:55.413
- YOU'RE IN THE SOUP NOW, UDON!
- 你现在在汤里了，乌冬面！

21:58.068 --> 22:00.275
- SANDY, I'M SORRY
I ACTED LIKE A JERK BACK THERE.
- 桑迪，对不起
我在那里表现得像个混蛋。

22:00.310 --> 22:01.827
THANKS FOR SAVING ME FROM...
感谢您将我从...中拯救出来

22:01.862 --> 22:02.827
gulp!
吞口水！

22:02.862 --> 22:04.344
BUYING A CONDO.
购买公寓。

22:04.379 --> 22:07.551
- OH, SHUCKS, SPONGEBOB,
THAT'S WHAT FRIENDS ARE FOR.
- 哦，蛋壳，海绵宝宝，
这就是朋友的意义。

22:07.586 --> 22:09.034
- I STILL HAVE ONE QUESTION,
THOUGH.
- 我还有一个问题，
不过。

22:09.068 --> 22:11.689
DOES THIS MEAN
I'M NOT KING OF KARATE ANYMORE?
这是否意味着
我不再是空手道之王了？

22:11.724 --> 22:13.689
- YOU ARE IN MY BOOK, SPONGEBOB.
- 你在我的书中，海绵宝宝。

22:13.724 --> 22:16.068
YOU ARE IN MY BOOK.
你在我的书中。

22:16.103 --> 22:17.689
NOW, LET ME TELL YOU
ABOUT REAL ESTATE.
现在，让我告诉你
关于房地产。

22:17.724 --> 22:20.275
IT'S ALL ABOUT LOCATION...
一切都与位置有关...

22:21.965 --> 22:23.379
- I'M HERE!
- 我在这里！

22:23.413 --> 22:27.241
THE KING OF CLARINETS
HAS ARRIVED!
单簧管之王
已经到了！

22:27.275 --> 22:30.034
[mysterious music playing]
【神秘音乐响起】

22:30.068 --> 22:32.344
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

22:35.310 --> 22:38.241
[lilting ukulele music]
[轻快的尤克里里音乐]

22:38.275 --> 22:45.310
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
